         Duties of the Office In Billerica, the Town Clerk is elected into office. Some of the duties of the office include: Recording of all births, deaths, and marriages, and issuing certified copies of same. Taking of marriage intentions. Issuing dog licenses. Fuel Storage Registrations. Record all official town documents. Keeper of the town seal. Taking and keeping all town meeting records. Responsibility for all elections. Other such duties as prescribed by Massachusetts General Laws, the Town Charter, and the general laws of the town. Click here for an interactive precinct map and search by your address. 
     

 
